cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SCRIPTORIUM in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SCRIPTORIUM — Historical Document Intelligence Platform"
abstract: >-
  Research platform for transcribing historical manuscripts and printed documents with
  Kraken handwritten text recognition (HTR/OCR): model registry with verified installation
  from Zenodo (TraPrInq, CATMuS), synchronised transcription editor with complete revision
  history, CER/WER evaluation against researcher ground truth, model comparison, fine-tuning,
  and schema-validated exports (TEI, ALTO, PAGE, hOCR).
authors:
